"""The contents of config-host.h for a Linux x86_64 host.

This is what QEMU's meson.build computes into config_host_data: host
feature probes, the enabled optional features and install paths.  It is
written out as config-host.h by //:config_host_h and is the dictionary
BUILD files test with qemu_when().

  True        #define NAME
  False       #undef NAME
  int         #define NAME <int>
  string      #define NAME <string>, verbatim (C string literals keep
              their quotes)

QEMU_VERSION and its parts come from the VERSION file (see
//:config_host_h).

Matches the Linux x86_64/GCC Meson reference for the KVM-only profile.
See the overlay README for the configure command.
"""

